window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>What do you do when all your fantasies come true and then they're ripped away from you?</b></p> <p>After years of being ashamed of what my body wanted, I took a leap and signed up for a fantasy through Dark Desires with three masked men. What was only supposed to be one night of sexual freedom quickly turned into a whirlwind romance with two of my masked strangers. That is until the third man was revealed and it all came crashing down around me.</p> <p>I chose to walk away from the men who did unspeakable things to my mind, body, and soul.</p> <p>But they're not giving me up without a fight.</p> <p>Will the repercussions be worth it if our story comes to light, or will I lose more than my heart?</p> <p>One is Never Enough <i>is a part of the Dark Desires series and is the continuation of the novella</i> Only for Tonight. <i>Each book can be listened to as a standalone but will have characters cross over from other books in the series. This is an MMMM romance and intended for mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
